message: "If you use these prompts, please cite the paper."
type: software
title: "CT-TEL-scaleup: Prompts for Scaling Up Formal Representation of Clinical Trial Protocols in Ensemble Logic Using LLMs"
abstract: >-
  Prompts accompanying the CT-TEL workflow, which translates narrative
  ClinicalTrials.gov protocols into Temporal Ensemble Logic formulas,
  reconstructs protocols from the formulas, and evaluates translation fidelity.
